 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? That's a great idea. Just remember to bring his harness and a long training lead too. Of course. What's up? Good. I' right here. So, on the long lead, what do you do? I changed my flight. I'm actually here now. Great. Put the lead on him and lead him around park a bit so he knows it's you and we' off the seat. No worries. Now let's head to the picnic. Keep the lead tight and don't move. He' soon realise he can't go anywhere.",
